  "The watch draws the Chinese calendar date only while its language is Chinese, from this table's frames: the year as a stem, a branch and 年 (23 frames), the month as 12 names and a leap marker (13), the day as 30 names. The preview follows the simulation date. Not yet confirmed on a watch.": "仅当手表语言为中文时才显示农历日期，使用此表中的帧：年份由天干、地支和“年”组成（23 帧），月份为 12 个名称加闰月标记（13 帧），日期为 30 个名称。预览跟随模拟日期。尚未在手表上确认。",
  "In metric units the watch counts swims in kilometres, like runs, and in imperial units in yards. Without the decimal point it rounds to whole kilometres, so 750 m shows 1; with it, 0.75. The decimal point needs CorosLink's compiler and is not yet confirmed on a watch.": "公制单位下，手表与跑步一样以公里计算游泳距离；英制单位下以码计算。没有小数点时四舍五入到整公里，750 m 显示为 1；有小数点则显示 0.75。小数点需要 CorosLink 的编译器，尚未在手表上确认。",
  "The watch rounds to whole kilometres or miles. Turn on the decimal point to show hundredths, such as 12.34. The decimal point needs CorosLink's compiler and is not yet confirmed on a watch.": "手表会四舍五入到整公里或整英里。开启小数点可显示到百分位，如 12.34。小数点需要 CorosLink 的编译器，尚未在手表上确认。",
  "Live calendar year binding recovered from COROS 4.9.9. Independently positioned and visible in the editor; it does not require a visible selectable metric. Unlike month/day, COROS stores it in the shared control container. Export preserves the required origin and converts editor coordinates automatically; do not enable or move the selectable metric to place the year. Preview follows the simulation date; device support requires on-watch verification.": "从 COROS 4.9.9 中恢复的实时年份绑定。可独立定位并在编辑器中显示，不需要可见的可选数据。与月、日不同，COROS 将其存放在共享控件容器中。导出时会保留所需原点并自动转换编辑器坐标；放置年份时无需开启或移动可选数据。预览跟随模拟日期；设备支持情况需在手表上验证。",
  "Weather data": "天气数据",
  "Minimum temperature": "最低温度",
  "The watch draws minimum and maximum temperature as one reading: minimum, separator, maximum, then one unit. With both shown, this layer places the reading and supplies the separator, unit and minus artwork.": "手表将最低和最高温度显示为一个读数：最低、分隔符、最高，再加一个单位。两者都显示时，由此图层定位读数，并提供分隔符、单位和负号图形。",
  "Maximum temperature": "最高温度",
  "The watch draws the maximum straight after the minimum and its separator, not at a position of its own. With both shown, move the minimum to place the reading.": "手表会将最高温度紧接在最低温度和分隔符之后显示，没有独立位置。两者都显示时，移动最低温度即可定位读数。",
  "Wind speed": "风速",
  "Wind direction": "风向",
  "Rain probability": "降水概率",
  "UV index": "紫外线指数",
  "Air quality index": "空气质量指数",
  "State artwork has seven frames: no data, then Good (0–50), Moderate (51–100), Unhealthy for sensitive groups (101–150), Unhealthy (151–200), Very unhealthy (201–300) and Hazardous (301+). The order is not yet confirmed on a watch.": "状态图形共 7 帧：无数据，然后是优（0–50）、良（51–100）、对敏感人群不健康（101–150）、不健康（151–200）、非常不健康（201–300）和危险（301+）。顺序尚未在手表上确认。",
  "Not available right now": "暂不可用",
  "Live AQI is unavailable in current PACE Pro testing, including in the watch’s Weather widget. The editor uses a sample value. Availability depends on COROS weather data.": "在当前 PACE Pro 测试中无法获取实时 AQI，手表的天气小组件中也没有。编辑器使用示例值。是否可用取决于 COROS 天气数据。",
  "Weekly training load": "每周训练负荷",
  "State artwork has seven frames: no data, then six levels. The watch's own levels and their order are not yet confirmed, so the editor previews them in 150-point steps of the sample load only.": "状态图形共 7 帧：无数据，然后是 6 个等级。手表自身的等级及顺序尚未确认，因此编辑器仅按示例负荷每 150 分一级进行预览。",
  "Stamina": "体能",
